        <!-- EVICTION -->
        <div class="answer-panel" data-answer="eviction" hidden>
          <div class="answer-head">
            <h3 class="answer-title" data-en="Facing eviction in Denver" data-es="Enfrentando un desalojo en Denver">Facing eviction in Denver</h3>
            <button class="answer-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
          </div>
          <p data-en="In Colorado a landlord cannot evict you without going to court. They must first give you a written notice, then file an eviction case (an &ldquo;FED&rdquo;) and win a judgment before the sheriff can remove you. Changing the locks, shutting off your utilities, or removing your belongings without a court order is an illegal &ldquo;self-help&rdquo; eviction." data-es="En Colorado un arrendador no puede desalojarte sin ir a la corte. Primero debe darte un aviso por escrito, luego presentar un caso de desalojo (un &ldquo;FED&rdquo;) y ganar una sentencia antes de que el alguacil pueda sacarte. Cambiar las cerraduras, cortar los servicios o sacar tus pertenencias sin orden judicial es un desalojo ilegal por &ldquo;mano propia&rdquo;.">
            In Colorado a landlord cannot evict you without going to court. They must first give you a written notice, then file an eviction case (an &ldquo;FED&rdquo;) and win a judgment before the sheriff can remove you. Changing the locks, shutting off your utilities, or removing your belongings without a court order is an illegal &ldquo;self-help&rdquo; eviction.
          </p>
          <h4 class="answer-subhead" data-en="Key rules" data-es="Reglas clave">Key rules</h4>
          <ul class="answer-list">
            <li data-en="Nonpayment of rent: landlords must give a 10-day written Demand for Compliance before filing." data-es="Falta de pago de renta: el arrendador debe dar un aviso escrito de 10 días (Demanda de Cumplimiento) antes de presentar el caso.">Nonpayment of rent: landlords must give a 10-day written Demand for Compliance before filing.</li>
            <li data-en="For-cause protections (2024): if you&rsquo;ve lived there 12+ months, a landlord generally needs a legal reason to evict or refuse to renew." data-es="Protecciones por causa (2024): si has vivido allí 12+ meses, el arrendador generalmente necesita una razón legal para desalojar o no renovar.">For-cause protections (2024): if you&rsquo;ve lived there 12+ months, a landlord generally needs a legal reason to evict or refuse to renew.</li>
            <li data-en="You must file a written &ldquo;Answer&rdquo; with the court by your appearance date — it&rsquo;s how you get a trial. Most tenants who lose simply never respond." data-es="Debes presentar una &ldquo;Respuesta&rdquo; escrita ante la corte antes de tu fecha de comparecencia — así obtienes un juicio. La mayoría que pierde simplemente nunca responde.">You must file a written &ldquo;Answer&rdquo; with the court by your appearance date — it&rsquo;s how you get a trial. Most tenants who lose simply never respond.</li>
            <li data-en="Having a lawyer dramatically improves outcomes. Denver and Colorado fund free eviction defense — ask before your court date." data-es="Tener un abogado mejora dramáticamente los resultados. Denver y Colorado financian defensa de desalojo gratuita — pregunta antes de tu fecha de corte.">Having a lawyer dramatically improves outcomes. Denver and Colorado fund free eviction defense — ask before your court date.</li>
          </ul>
          <h4 class="answer-subhead" data-en="Where to get help" data-es="Dónde obtener ayuda">Where to get help</h4>
          <div class="resource-list">
            <a class="resource" href="tel:18449266632">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632" data-es="Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632">Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="Free statewide hotline for tenants: rights, eviction help, and referrals." data-es="Línea gratuita estatal para inquilinos: derechos, ayuda con desalojos y referencias.">Free statewide hotline for tenants: rights, eviction help, and referrals.</span>
            </a>
            <a class="resource" href="tel:3038371321">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321" data-es="Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321">Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="Free civil legal aid, including eviction defense, for income-qualifying renters." data-es="Asistencia legal civil gratuita, incluida defensa de desalojo, para inquilinos que califican por ingresos.">Free civil legal aid, including eviction defense, for income-qualifying renters.</span>
            </a>
            <a class="resource" href="https://www.denvergov.org/Government/Agencies-Departments-Offices/Agencies-Departments-Offices-Directory/Department-of-Housing-Stability" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Denver Dept. of Housing Stability (HOST)" data-es="Departamento de Estabilidad de Vivienda de Denver (HOST)">Denver Dept. of Housing Stability (HOST)</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="City rental and eviction assistance programs and partner referrals." data-es="Programas municipales de asistencia de alquiler y desalojo, y referencias a socios.">City rental and eviction assistance programs and partner referrals.</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="answer-sources">
            <span class="answer-sources__label" data-en="Sources" data-es="Fuentes">Sources</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 13-40-104 (2024).</li>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 13-40-111 (2024).</li>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 38-12-510 (2024).</li>
              <li>Cause Required for Eviction of Residential Tenant, H.B. 24-1098, 74th Gen. Assemb., 2d Reg. Sess. (Colo. 2024) (codified at Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect;&sect; 38-12-1300 to -1305).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- REPAIRS -->
        <div class="answer-panel" data-answer="repairs" hidden>
          <div class="answer-head">
            <h3 class="answer-title" data-en="Repairs &amp; habitability" data-es="Reparaciones y habitabilidad">Repairs &amp; habitability</h3>
            <button class="answer-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
          </div>
          <p data-en="Colorado&rsquo;s Warranty of Habitability requires landlords to keep rentals safe and livable — working heat, plumbing, hot water, weatherproofing, working appliances they provided, and no mold, pests, or other serious hazards. This right can&rsquo;t be waived in your lease." data-es="La Garantía de Habitabilidad de Colorado exige que el arrendador mantenga la vivienda segura y habitable — calefacción, plomería, agua caliente, protección contra la intemperie, electrodomésticos que él proporcionó funcionando, y sin moho, plagas u otros peligros serios. Este derecho no se puede renunciar en el contrato.">
            Colorado&rsquo;s Warranty of Habitability requires landlords to keep rentals safe and livable — working heat, plumbing, hot water, weatherproofing, working appliances they provided, and no mold, pests, or other serious hazards. This right can&rsquo;t be waived in your lease.
          </p>
          <h4 class="answer-subhead" data-en="Key rules" data-es="Reglas clave">Key rules</h4>
          <ul class="answer-list">
            <li data-en="Tell your landlord in writing (keep a copy). Note the date and the problem." data-es="Avisa a tu arrendador por escrito (guarda una copia). Anota la fecha y el problema.">Tell your landlord in writing (keep a copy). Note the date and the problem.</li>
            <li data-en="For a condition that&rsquo;s dangerous to life, health, or safety, the landlord must begin repairs within 24 hours; for other habitability problems, within 96 hours." data-es="Para una condición peligrosa para la vida, la salud o la seguridad, el arrendador debe comenzar reparaciones en 24 horas; para otros problemas de habitabilidad, en 96 horas.">For a condition that&rsquo;s dangerous to life, health, or safety, the landlord must begin repairs within 24 hours; for other habitability problems, within 96 hours.</li>
            <li data-en="If they don&rsquo;t act, you may have remedies — repair-and-deduct, ending the lease, or suing for damages. Get advice before withholding rent." data-es="Si no actúan, puedes tener remedios — reparar y deducir, terminar el contrato o demandar por daños. Busca asesoría antes de retener la renta.">If they don&rsquo;t act, you may have remedies — repair-and-deduct, ending the lease, or suing for damages. Get advice before withholding rent.</li>
            <li data-en="Retaliation — raising rent or evicting because you asked for repairs — is illegal in Colorado." data-es="La represalia — subir la renta o desalojar porque pediste reparaciones — es ilegal en Colorado.">Retaliation — raising rent or evicting because you asked for repairs — is illegal in Colorado.</li>
          </ul>
          <h4 class="answer-subhead" data-en="Where to get help" data-es="Dónde obtener ayuda">Where to get help</h4>
          <div class="resource-list">
            <a class="resource" href="tel:7209131311">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Denver 311 — (720) 913-1311" data-es="Denver 311 — (720) 913-1311">Denver 311 — (720) 913-1311</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="Report housing code violations to Denver for an inspection." data-es="Reporta violaciones del código de vivienda a Denver para una inspección.">Report housing code violations to Denver for an inspection.</span>
            </a>
            <a class="resource" href="tel:18449266632">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632" data-es="Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632">Colorado Housing Connects — (844) 926-6632</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="Free guidance on habitability problems and your next steps." data-es="Orientación gratuita sobre problemas de habitabilidad y tus próximos pasos.">Free guidance on habitability problems and your next steps.</span>
            </a>
            <a class="resource" href="tel:3038371321">
              <span class="resource-name" data-en="Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321" data-es="Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321">Colorado Legal Services — (303) 837-1321</span>
              <span class="resource-desc" data-en="Free legal aid if a landlord won&rsquo;t make required repairs." data-es="Asistencia legal gratuita si un arrendador no hace las reparaciones requeridas.">Free legal aid if a landlord won&rsquo;t make required repairs.</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="answer-sources">
            <span class="answer-sources__label" data-en="Sources" data-es="Fuentes">Sources</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 38-12-503 (2024).</li>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 38-12-507 (2024).</li>
              <li>Colo. Rev. Stat. &sect; 38-12-509 (2024).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
